{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold Response</strong> puts you in the seat of a drone operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll deploy and pilot custom built FPV drones in a near-future Scandinavian military conflict as the last line of defense. Strategize, improvise, and strike back against invading forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/22b09b7c2244ee9cf90ccd195536ecea.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/22b09b7c2244ee9cf90ccd195536ecea.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/22b09b7c2244ee9cf90ccd195536ecea.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the environment reacts: seasons shift, days turn into nights, and structures collapse under fire. Every flight is a test. Every crash is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take to the Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot freely across a small, isolated, Swedish village. Hone your flight techniques, crash through buildings, enemies and test weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod your drone builds endlessly. Equip them with absurd weapons, from shotguns and grenades to recoilless rifles like the traditional Swedish Pansarskott M/86.<br><br>The only answer to violence is\u00a0<i>more</i> violence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the Line</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, scavenge for spare parts, and launch specialized drones to hold off incoming enemy forces. Every drone lost is a setback. Every decision matters. You'll command kamikaze drones, recon units, and heavy assault models, each with customizable load-outs and real-time feedback. Build your strategy. Hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic (Combat) Drone Simulation with Sandbox Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose drones, upgrades, weapons and parts to create the right tool for the right job</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the homeland from the scourge in a highly destructible world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A never ending struggle against enemies, weather seasons, fauna, gravity, you personally and time itself to try and stay alive</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831420?t=1766172306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/03666f0244c98f49649fb1c79f151f33c3292dcb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766172306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/fde10654703ca146ab61aba994780ee6e694ff32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766172306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/fde10654703ca146ab61aba994780ee6e694ff32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766172306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You kill people with exploding drones."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cold Response</strong> puts you in the seat of a drone operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll deploy and pilot custom built FPV drones in a near-future Scandinavian military conflict as the last line of defense. Strategize, improvise, and strike back against invading forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/22b09b7c2244ee9cf90ccd195536ecea.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/22b09b7c2244ee9cf90ccd195536ecea.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/22b09b7c2244ee9cf90ccd195536ecea.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything in the environment reacts: seasons shift, days turn into nights, and structures collapse under fire. Every flight is a test. Every crash is a lesson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/555cba01ff988f406583eee7d0e3ca2b.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take to the Skies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot freely across a small, isolated, Swedish village. Hone your flight techniques, crash through buildings, enemies and test weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod your drone builds endlessly. Equip them with absurd weapons, from shotguns and grenades to recoilless rifles like the traditional Swedish Pansarskott M/86.<br><br>The only answer to violence is\u00a0<i>more</i> violence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/424d1617467cb0dd39791d16095719db.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the Line</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, scavenge for spare parts, and launch specialized drones to hold off incoming enemy forces. Every drone lost is a setback. Every decision matters. You'll command kamikaze drones, recon units, and heavy assault models, each with customizable load-outs and real-time feedback. Build your strategy. Hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.poster.avif?t=1766172306\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.webm?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/extras/7d5b5cb6f4f839f0f1f186fbb586f65b.mp4?t=1766172306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic (Combat) Drone Simulation with Sandbox Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compose drones, upgrades, weapons and parts to create the right tool for the right job</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the homeland from the scourge in a highly destructible world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A never ending struggle against enemies, weather seasons, fauna, gravity, you personally and time itself to try and stay alive</p>","developers":["Eternal Minds"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831420/21d031693b3f6e1770cc2f4a84a30ba86e9b609f/header.jpg?t=1766172306","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sequioa<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel/M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sequioa<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3831420/64